i class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-4\" data-check-id=\"type3-4\"> <span><em>나무타기</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-5\" data-check-id=\"type3-5\"> <span><em>영리함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-6\" data-check-id=\"type3-6\"> <span><em>끈질김</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-7\" data-check-id=\"type3-7\"> <span><em>빠름</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"처음부터 선택됨\"> <span><em>사나움</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-9\" data-check-id=\"type3-9\"> <span><em>밝은 귀</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-10\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-10\" data-check-id=\"type3-10\"> <span><em>기민함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-11\" data-check-id=\"type3-11\"> <span><em>무리 사냥꾼</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-12\" data-check-id=\"type3-12\"> <span><em>예민한 코</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-13\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-13\" data-check-id=\"type3-13\"> <span><em>참을성</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-14\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-14\" data-check-id=\"type3-14\"> <span><em>힘셈</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-15\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-15\" data-check-id=\"type3-15\"> <span><em>은밀함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-16\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-16\" data-check-id=\"type3-16\"> <span><em>무시무시함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type3-blank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type3-blank0\" data-check-id=\"type3-blank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type3-blank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n</div><div class=\"fs-type\">\n<div class=\"fs-type-head\"><label for=\"ac-type4-pick\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-type4-pick\" data-check-id=\"type4-pick\"> <strong>탈것</strong></label> <span class=\"fs-muted\">(말, 노새, <input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type4-other\" placeholder=\"…\" aria-label=\"…\" autocomplete=\"off\">)</span></div>\n<p class=\"stat-line\">HP 12; 방어구 0; 피해 d6+1 (<em>근접</em>, <em>지근</em>)</p>\n<p class=\"fs-muted\">4개 더 선택:</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-picks\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-0\" data-check-id=\"type4-0\"> <span>+4 HP</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-1\" data-check-id=\"type4-1\"> <span>+1 방어구 (가죽)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-2\" data-check-id=\"type4-2\"> <span>피해가 +2 피해, <em>밀쳐냄</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-3\" data-check-id=\"type4-3\"> <span><em>공격적</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-4\" data-check-id=\"type4-4\"> <span><em>날램</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-5\" data-check-id=\"type4-5\"> <span><em>아름다움</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-6\" data-check-id=\"type4-6\"> <span><em>차분함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-7\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-7\" data-check-id=\"type4-7\"> <span><em>영리함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-8\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-8\" data-check-id=\"type4-8\"> <span><em>강건함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-9\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-9\" data-check-id=\"type4-9\"> <span><em>예민한 코</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label><input type=\"checkbox\" checked disabled aria-label=\"처음부터 선택됨\"> <span><em>큼직함</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-11\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-11\" data-check-id=\"type4-11\"> <span><em>힘셈</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-12\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-12\" data-check-id=\"type4-12\"> <span><em>쾌속</em></span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"type4-blank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"type4-blank0\" data-check-id=\"type4-blank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:type4-blank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"instinct\">본능</h3>\n<p>1개 선택.</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst0\" data-check-id=\"inst0\"> <span>괴롭히고 위협한다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst1\" data-check-id=\"inst1\"> <span>말썽을 부린다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst2\" data-check-id=\"inst2\"> <span>배를 채운다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst3\" data-check-id=\"inst3\"> <span>놀라서 허둥댄다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst4\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst4\" data-check-id=\"inst4\"> <span>한눈을 판다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst5\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst5\" data-check-id=\"inst5\"> <span>날뛴다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"inst6\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"inst6\" data-check-id=\"inst6\"> <span>뒤쫓는다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"instblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"instblank0\" data-check-id=\"instblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:instblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"cost\">대가</h3>\n<div class=\"fs-row\"><p>1개 선택.</p><div class=\"arcana-track fs-loyalty\" data-check-list=\"ac-loyalty\"><span class=\"track-label\">충성</span><span class=\"track-steps\"><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-0\" title=\"충성 1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-0\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-0\" aria-label=\"충성 1\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-1\" title=\"충성 2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-1\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-1\" aria-label=\"충성 2\"></label><label class=\"track-step\" for=\"ac-loyalty-2\" title=\"충성 3\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"ac-loyalty-2\" data-check-id=\"ac-loyalty-2\" aria-label=\"충성 3\"></label></span></div></div>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost0\" data-check-id=\"cost0\"> <span>놀이, 손질, 훈련, 애정</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost1\" data-check-id=\"cost1\"> <span>홀로 보내는 시간, 마음껏 쏘다니기</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"cost2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"cost2\" data-check-id=\"cost2\"> <span>아늑한 잠자리, 안락함, 넉넉한 먹이</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"costblank0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"costblank0\" data-check-id=\"costblank0\"></label><input type=\"text\" class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:costblank0\" placeholder=\"write in\" aria-label=\"직접 기입\" autocomplete=\"off\"></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"beast-of-legend\">전설의 짐승</h3>\n<p>'전설의 짐승'을 얻을 때마다, 1개 선택:</p>\n<ul class=\"check-list fs-lines\"><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend0\" data-check-id=\"legend0\"> <span>그 짐승은 <em>걸출</em> 해진다 (아래 '추종자에게 명령하기' 참조)</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend1\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend1\" data-check-id=\"legend1\"> <span>+4 HP와 +1 방어구를 얻는다</span></label></li><li class=\"check-item\"><label for=\"legend2\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"wiki-check\" id=\"legend2\" data-check-id=\"legend2\"> <span>오직 하나뿐인 능력이나 특성이 생겨난다</span></label></li></ul>\n<div class=\"fs-field fs-notes\"><span class=\"fs-label\">메모</span><textarea class=\"wiki-field\" data-field-key=\"animal-companion:notes\" rows=\"3\" aria-label=\"메모\"></textarea></div>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"order-followers\">추종자에게 명령하기</h3>\n<p>네가 <strong><em>그들에게 무브를 하라고 지시하고 그들이 그리할</em></strong>때, 그들의 태그가 하나라도 들어맞으면 +능력치 대신 +1로 굴린다( <em>걸출</em>하기까지 하면 +2). 들어맞는 태그가 없으면 +0으로 굴린다. 태그가 오히려 방해가 된다면 불리하게 굴린다.</p>\n<p>그들이 <strong><em>지시 없이 있을</em></strong> 때, 또는 <strong><em>제 뜻대로 움직일</em></strong> 때는, 무엇을 어떻게 하는지 GM이 말한다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"strengthen-your-bond\">유대 다지기</h3>\n<p>네가 <strong><em>그들의 대가를 치르고</em></strong> 근래에 그런 적이 없다면, 그들은 충성 +1을 홀드한다(최대 3).</p>\n<p>충성을 1:1로 소비하여 다음을 시킬 수 있다:</p>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>두려움을 무릅쓰고 네 말대로 하게 한다</li><li>본능/태그/기질대로 움직이려는 것을 참게 한다</li><li>내키지 않는 일을 하게 한다 (끔찍하거나 자살 행위가 아닌 한)</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"loyal-to-the-end\">끝까지 충성</h3>\n<p>만약 <strong><em>동료가 HP 0이 되면</em></strong>, +0으로 굴린다. 충성을 홀드하고 있다면 유리하게: <strong>10+이면</strong>, HP를 조금이라도 되찾으면 멀쩡해진다; <strong>7-9면</strong>, 태그 <em>부상</em> 을 얻는다; <strong>6-면</strong>, 부상을 입고, 누군가 구해 주지 않으면 머지않아 죽는다.</p>"
}
